{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10206","headline":"送郑正则汉阳迎妇 · 李嘉佑","name":"送郑正则汉阳迎妇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦字相催鸟急飞，郎君暂脱老莱衣。\n遥想双眉待人画，行看五马送潮归。\n望夫山上花犹发，新妇江边莺未稀。\n令秩和鸣真可羡，此行谁道负春辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}